WordCraft is a native Rust word processor, ported to Termux (Android, X11) in this repository.

Upstream: https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft
This port: https://github.com/ProSteve123GH/wordcraft

License: MIT OR Apache-2.0, at your option. The full texts are in the upstream repository:
  https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft/blob/main/LICENSE-MIT
  https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft/blob/main/LICENSE-APACHE

The package bundles no fonts, icons or other artwork from Microsoft Office or any other
proprietary product. The application icon is part of the upstream project's own asset set.
